sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Old as Existing Device
    participant New as New Device
    participant S as Room Server

    User->>New: Choose Add Existing Account
    User->>Old: Approve Link Device
    Old->>New: Pair locally and transfer server list
    New->>S: NIP-98 login and register device
    New->>S: Upload fresh KeyPackages
    Old->>S: Fetch device package refs for new device
    loop For each room hosted on this server
        Old->>Old: Create MLS add-device commit
        Old->>S: Submit ordered commit bundle
        S-->>Old: Commit accepted at canonical room sequence
        S-->>New: Store and expose Welcome plus room log
        New->>S: Sync pending welcomes and room events
        New->>New: Join room and persist state
    end
    User->>New: Sees linking progress until all rooms are joined
